            `getUpdates: session expired (errcode=${resp.errcode} ret=${resp.ret}), pausing all requests for ${Math.ceil(pauseMs / 60_000)} min`,
          );
          consecutiveFailures = 0;
          await sleep(pauseMs, abortSignal);
